        "PMC9820961::web::024::3_1_phase_structure_and_morphology_of_co"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-sprayed baseline has minimal pre-existing surface oxide.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxidative pre-treatment at 700–900 °C will rapidly produce a continuous, dense oxide layer on FeNiCrCoCu.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10908794::web::037::microstructure_investigation"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-treatment-induced oxide will be Cr-rich and primarily Cr2O3.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10908794::web::037::microstructure_investigation",
        "PMC9820961::web::024::3_1_phase_structure_and_morphology_of_co"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Cr-rich oxide layer improves the high-temperature wear resistance of the coating.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10908794::web::037::microstructure_investigation"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-rich oxide passivates the surface and protects the underlying metal from severe abrasive and adhesive wear.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10908794::web::037::microstructure_investigation"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide barrier reduces direct metal-to-metal contact during sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide barrier lowers friction.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide changes the dominant wear mechanism from abrasive or adhesive wear to a self-limiting oxidative-wear regime.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9820961::web::024::3_1_phase_structure_and_morphology_of_co"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-rich oxide may self-heal under repeated sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxidatively pre-treated coatings will have a more continuous and robust Cr-rich oxide film than untreated coatings.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10908794::web::037::microstructure_investigation"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-treated coatings will exhibit a lower friction coefficient than the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-treated coatings will have lower wear volume, spalling, and crack formation than the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9820961::web::024::3_1_phase_structure_and_morphology_of_co",
        "PMC10908794::web::037::microstructure_investigation"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-treated wear track will show stable oxidative-wear features relative to the untreated baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
